        "idempotentHint": true,
        "openWorldHint": true,
        "readOnlyHint": true,
        "title": "Diagnose Selector"
      },
      "description": "Explain why a selector finds nothing or cannot be used: invalid syntax (with the browser's message), no match, matches that are hidden, empty, off screen, disabled or covered by another element, matches inside an iframe or a shadow root, and near misses such as a similar id or the same text in different case. Ends with next steps.",
      "inputSchema": {
